        },
        {
          "text": "Nubakwesu, nsiyandi kuti mutazibi aya makani aasisidwe, kuti mutalisumpuli mumiyeeyo yanu, aakuti buyumu bwa-Israyeli mbwacipanzi buyo, mane do unjile mweelwe woonse wabamasi, ",
